{"nodes": [{"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_o4mini_runtime_result", "label": "o4-mini Gateway Runtime Result", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "5,236 s solo for 51 rules; explanations largely succeeded (193/204) but only 14/51 secure examples were produced at all. The decisive result is quality, not speed, which makes the model unsuitable for the code-example feature as currently configured."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "label": "Empty-Completion Failure Mode", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "o4-mini returns a completion with no content, so the compile gate is never reached and the repair loop never engages \u2014 a categorically different and more serious failure than Qwen3-30B and gpt-4o-mini, which at least produced code that could be checked and repaired."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_reproduced_under_clean_conditions", "label": "Failure Reproduced Under Clean Conditions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "48 empty completions in each of two runs, one concurrent and one solo \u2014 an almost exact reproduction that rules out the measurement conditions as the cause and establishes the failure as a property of the model on this workload."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_max_tokens_reasoning_hypothesis", "label": "max_tokens Budget Exhaustion Hypothesis", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The secure path sends max_tokens=2000 with a large system message while the insecure path sends no max_tokens at all, and o4-mini spends 1,024\u20131,216 tokens on hidden reasoning before emitting visible output \u2014 but isolated reproduction attempts returned working code every time, so the correlation is stated as an open question and no causal claim is made."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_concurrency_natural_control", "label": "Two-Phase Natural Control for Concurrency Cost", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The competing job exited midway, so Run 1's explanation phase was contended while its example phase already ran solo. The contended phase improved 38.0% and the already-solo phase only 4.2% \u2014 had time-of-day gateway load been the cause both phases would have shifted together, which isolates concurrency far more confidently than a single-model comparison could."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_variance_is_queueing_noise", "label": "Per-Rule Variance Is Queueing Noise", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo, the slowest explanation is 1.7\u00d7 the fastest against 4.7\u00d7 under concurrency, and IvParameterSpec went from the single slowest rule of Run 1 to below the median \u2014 most apparent per-rule difficulty was contention, not specification complexity."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_getorcreatetempdir_defect", "label": "CrySLReader.getOrCreateTempDir Concurrency Defect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It resolves a fixed path ${java.io.tmpdir}/cognicryptdoc_resources identical for every JVM and registers it with deleteOnExit(); when the concurrent job exited, its shutdown hooks deleted the directory out from under a still-running job and the atomic move of frontpage.ftl failed with NoSuchFileException. The temp directory is not scoped per run."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_cache_based_recovery", "label": "Cache-Based Run Recovery with --llm=off", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Re-running with --llm=off against the same --reportPath reused every cached explanation and example, made no API calls, and rendered all 51 pages in 1.4 s \u2014 the crashed run's site was recovered without repeating two hours of model work, with cache contents verified byte-for-byte against a pre-recovery backup."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_three_tier_architecture", "label": "Three-Tier Pipeline (o4-mini report)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "label": "Compile-Verify-Repair Loop (o4-mini report)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_misleading_cheap_example_phase", "label": "Misleadingly Cheap Example Phase", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The code-example phase looks cheap per rule only because most secure examples failed outright and never entered the compile-repair loop; a better-performing model would spend more time in this phase, not less."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_backend_comparison", "label": "Backend Comparison Table (o4-mini report)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_o4mini_runtime_result", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_reproduced_under_clean_conditions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_max_tokens_reasoning_hypothesis", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_O4MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_misleading_cheap_example_phase", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_empty_completion_failure_mode", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_sc